# Google Maps API Key configuration for Geo Alarm
# 1. For Android local builds, add MAPS_API_KEY to android/local.properties:
#    MAPS_API_KEY=AIzaSy...
# 2. For Flutter Web / Dart-define builds:
#    flutter run --dart-define=MAPS_API_KEY=AIzaSy...
# 3. For CI / CD pipelines, set MAPS_API_KEY as an environment variable.
MAPS_API_KEY=YOUR_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY
